# Flow review process artifacts.
#
# Only terminal review verdicts, the durable baseline receipt, and the
# consolidated ledger belong in version control. Everything below is either an
# orchestration transcript, session telemetry, or a regenerable tool output —
# none of it is a governance record, and all of it bloats feature PRs.
.flow/reviews/*.events.jsonl
.flow/reviews/*.log
.flow/reviews/**/*.log
.flow/reviews/*.raw.txt
.flow/reviews/*.raw.json
.flow/reviews/*-prompt.md
.flow/reviews/*.prompt.md
.flow/reviews/*.schema.json
# Harness result/receipt envelopes: model, session id, token counts, USD cost.
.flow/reviews/*.result.json
.flow/reviews/*.receipt.json
.flow/*-receipt.json
# Local convenience symlink into a session-scoped debug log.
.flow/reviews/latest
# Regenerable browser-evidence output of `bun run test:e2e:pdf`
# (scripts/pdf-viewer-smoke.ts writes here). Hashes live in the ledger.
.flow/reviews/fn-112-task-6-evidence/

